<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-headline-sm text-body-sm font-semibold text-primary">Arquitectura NamiO</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-code-kbd">10:42 AM</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm font-medium text-on-surface truncate mt-0.5">Sincronización IMAP local y colas offline</p>
<p class="font-body-sm text-xs text-on-surface-variant truncate mt-1">El nuevo motor almacena cada mensaje localmente para lectura instantánea...</p>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-2">
<span class="bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container font-label-sm text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">Seguridad</span>
<span class="bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">v0.4.0</span>
</div>
</div>

