<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm font-medium text-on-surface">GitHub Releases</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant font-code-kbd">Ayer</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface truncate mt-0.5">Novedades del proyecto NamiO</p>
<p class="font-body-sm text-xs text-on-surface-variant truncate mt-1">Se han generado los paquetes automáticos para distribuciones Linux...</p>
</div>

<div class="bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high p-3 rounded-xl transition-colors cursor-pointer">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm font-medium text-on-surface">Comunidad Linux</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant font-code-kbd">24 May</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface truncate mt-0.5">Feedback sobre el modo "El correo es papel"</p>
<p class="font-body-sm text-xs text-on-surface-variant truncate mt-1">Excelente decisión mantener la lectura en lienzo claro para correos complejos...</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="hidden sm:flex items-center justify-between pt-3 text-outline text-[11px] font-code-kbd">
